{"story":{"id":"anomaly-tomb-world-cat","title":{"zh":"死寂星球","en":"Tomb World"},"category":"exploration","kind":"anomaly","image":"art/53283e01115c7b762068.webp","start":"anomalies:tomb_world_cat","chapters":5,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"异常读数表明，这座荒凉的星球或许不只是表面上看起来那样而已。","en":"Unusual readings suggest there may be more to this desolate world than meets the eye."},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"anomalies:tomb_world_cat","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry"},"children":["n2","n3"]},"n2":{"doc":"distar.2005","parent":"n1","via":{"modified":true,"chance":1.0,"group":"r29412","hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"research","source":"common/anomalies/95_anomaly_categories_distant_stars.txt:1370"},"children":["n4"]},"n3":{"doc":"distar.2015","parent":"n1","via":{"modified":true,"chance":1.0,"group":"r29412","hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"research","source":"common/anomalies/95_anomaly_categories_distant_stars.txt:1382"},"children":[]},"n4":{"doc":"special_projects:WEAPONS_TESTING","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"distar.2005.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_2.txt:3382"},"children":["n5"]},"n5":{"doc":"distar.2006","parent":"n4","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt:1220"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"anomalies:tomb_world_cat","kind":"anomaly","title":{"zh":"死寂星球","en":"Tomb World"},"texts":[{"zh":"异常读数表明，这座荒凉的星球或许不只是表面上看起来那样而已。","en":"Unusual readings suggest there may be more to this desolate world than meets the eye."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/53283e01115c7b762068.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"distar.2005","kind":"research","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"research","chance":1.0,"group":"r29412","modified":true,"source":"common/anomalies/95_anomaly_categories_distant_stars.txt:1370","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-tomb-world-cat"},{"target":"distar.2015","kind":"research","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"research","chance":1.0,"group":"r29412","modified":true,"source":"common/anomalies/95_anomaly_categories_distant_stars.txt:1382","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-tomb-world-cat"}],"source":{"file":"common/anomalies/95_anomaly_categories_distant_stars.txt","line":1353}},{"id":"distar.2005","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"武器测试","en":"Weapon Testing"},"texts":[{"zh":"看来[From.GetName]经历过多次末日。表面扫描显示，这颗星球曾被某种我们未曾遭遇过的大规模武器测试狂轰滥炸过。\n\n尽管外星人曾多次试图彻底毁灭这颗星球，但他们似乎仍未掌握这种科技。科学专员[Root.GetLeaderName]收集了一系列损坏的武器残骸，希望能够复原它们的武器。","en":"It seems the apocalypse has come to [From.GetName] many times over. Surface scans reveal that the planet has been scorched, bombarded, seared and peppered in what is surely some of the most extensive weapon testing we have yet to encounter.\n\nThough countless attempts have been made to obliterate the planet entirely, it appears the aliens had not yet developed the technology for it. Science Officer [Root.GetLeaderName] has collected an assortment of broken weapon remains in the hopes of recreating their designs."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/2fc46ebb786a067345ba.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"distar.2005.a","label":{"zh":"分析那些样本。","en":"Analyze the samples."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:WEAPONS_TESTING","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_2.txt:3382","story":"anomaly-tomb-world-cat"}],"terminal":false},{"key":"distar.2005.b","label":{"zh":"离开。","en":"Leave."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[{"target":"story.5","kind":"delay","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"delay","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/distant_stars_events_2.txt:3373","hooks":["immediate"],"story":"origin_fear_of_the_dark"}],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_2.txt","line":3362},"names":{"From.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"},"Root.GetLeaderName":{"zh":"这位领袖","en":"the leader"}}},{"id":"special_projects:WEAPONS_TESTING","kind":"project","title":{"zh":"外星武器","en":"Alien Weapons"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们在[From.GetName]上收集了用于测试的外星武器残骸，以供分析。","en":"We have gathered the remains of alien weaponry used in extensive weapon testing on [From.GetName] for analysis."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/c6521a2bac2bb7c2248c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"distar.2006","kind":"project","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt:1220","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-tomb-world-cat"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt","line":1203}},{"id":"distar.2006","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"外星激光","en":"Alien Lasers"},"texts":[{"zh":"通过对[From.From.GetName]上找到的武器进行研究，我们学到了很多。回收的碎片来自一种定向能武器系统，发射高度集中的能源束，可在太空战中起到很好的效果。科学专员[science_leader.GetName]建议我们要么开发能够抵御激光的装甲，要么复制激光武器来装备自己。","en":"We have learned much from analyzing the remains of the weapons found on [From.From.From.GetName]. The recovered fragments were from a mounted directed-energy weapon system that emits a highly focused energy ray that can be used with great results in space warfare. Science Officer [science_leader.GetName] recommends we use our finds either by developing armor to counter the lasers or by recreating the weapons for ourselves."},{"zh":"通过对[From.From.From.GetName]上找到的武器进行研究，我们学到了很多。回收的碎片来自一种定向能武器系统，发射高度集中的能源束，与我们的激光类似，但较为低劣。","en":"We have learned much from analyzing the remains of the weapons found on [From.From.From.GetName]. The fragments we discovered came from a mounted directed-energy weapon system, that emits a highly focused energy ray, similar but hopelessly inferior to our own lasers."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/c6521a2bac2bb7c2248c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"distar.2006.a","label":{"zh":"我们将用外星人的武器对付他们！","en":"We will use the aliens' weapons against them!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_1","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"红激光发射器","en":"Red Lasers"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_2","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"蓝激光发射器","en":"Blue Lasers"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_3","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"紫外激光发射器","en":"UV Lasers"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_4","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"X射线发射器","en":"X-Ray Lasers"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_5","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"伽马激光","en":"Gamma Lasers"}}]]},{"key":"distar.2006.b","label":{"zh":"我们需要给舰船装上装甲。","en":"We need armor for our ships."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_ship_armor_1","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"纳米复合材料","en":"Nanocomposite Materials"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_ship_armor_2","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"瓷金复合材料","en":"Ceramo-Metal Materials"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_ship_armor_3","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"塑钢材料","en":"Plasteel Materials"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_ship_armor_4","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"耐钢材料","en":"Durasteel Materials"}}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_ship_armor_5","scope":"","value":false,"label":{"zh":"零素材料","en":"Neutronium Materials"}}]]},{"key":"distar.2006.c","label":{"zh":"我们再次确认了自己的优越。","en":"Again we have confirmed our superiority."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","arg":"tech_lasers_1","scope":"","value":true,"label":{"zh":"红激光发射器","en":"Red Lasers"}},{"type":"other","key":"has_technology","ar